# Project rules

Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/AI_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`, and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
before editing. Preserve the current-temperature-only scope and the finite,
traceable tool-calling loop.

The LLM may only receive `get_current_temperatures`. Never add arbitrary network,
shell, filesystem, forecast, or general-knowledge tools. The Open-Meteo forecast
request must remain limited to `current=temperature_2m`.

Use dependency injection at LLM and HTTP boundaries. Add or update tests for every
behavior change. Run Ruff format/check, mypy, and pytest with coverage before
declaring completion. Update the AI plan and changelog at the end of a session.
